"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>and message <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ec.<span class=\"me1\">message</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span><span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>error condition for io_errc::stream has value 1\nand message \"unspecified iostream_category error\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2087\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2087</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td><code>make_error_condition(io_errc)</code> was not declared <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>declared <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span></span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_condition\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>error_condition</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  holds a portable error code <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp